#!/usr/bin/env python3
r"""
backfill_fundamentals_futu.py — Futu F10 fundamental data backfill for HK stocks.

Fetches PE, PB, dividend_yield, ROE, revenue_growth via Futu OpenAPI F10 endpoints:
  - get_valuation_detail         → daily PE/PB historical series (5yr default)
  - get_financials_statements    → quarterly ROE (key metrics), revenue growth
                                   (income statement yoy)
  - get_corporate_actions_dividends → dividend history → trailing 12M yield

Output: data/fundamentals/HK_<code>_fundamentals.csv
  Daily-grain, PIT-correct for backtesting:
    date, pe, pb, dividend_yield, roe, revenue_growth, report_date

  pe/pb/dividend_yield are truly daily (point-in-time).
  roe/revenue_growth are quarterly, forward-filled onto the daily index
  (PIT-correct: you only know the last reported value until the next report).

Usage:
    python backfill_fundamentals_futu.py                  # all HSI_CORE (52)
    python backfill_fundamentals_futu.py --stocks HK.00700 HK.09988
    python backfill_fundamentals_futu.py --workers 4       # parallel threads
    python backfill_fundamentals_futu.py --years 5         # PE/PB history depth
    python backfill_fundamentals_futu.py --force           # re-fetch existing

Rate limits: Futu 60 req/30s → self-limited to 50 req/30s (safety margin).
Each worker thread creates its own OpenQuoteContext (OpenD supports multiple
simultaneous connections).

NOTE: Futu OpenD must be running (127.0.0.1:11111) before executing this script.
      Start FutuOpenD GUI or run: python -c "from futu import *"
"""
